<div class="blog-summary__update-wrapper">
    
</div>

<div class="blog-summary__summary">
    <p data-block-key="azy3l">Sensible Agent is a research prototype that enables AR agents to proactively adapt what they suggest and how they interact, using real-time context, including gaze, hand availability, and environmental noise.</p>
</div>
                        
